This file gathers and re-exports the basic rational coding, surjectivity of rational decoding, primitive recursiveness of the positive numerator part, the negative numerator part, and the denominator, positivity of the denominator, primitive recursiveness of the comparison code together with its correctness and its bound by one, primitive recursiveness of the strict comparison code together with its bound, its correctness, and recursive decidability of strict comparison, primitive recursiveness of the maximum and minimum codes and their decoding equations, and primitive recursiveness of the midpoint code, the denominator of a midpoint, and both forms of the midpoint decoding equation.
